Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:18.26,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be like her someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:24.99,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're always so amazing, Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.99,0:00:27.88,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tired of trite compliments\N like "amazing."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:30.84,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, with your intellect,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:34.71,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it's the best you're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:36.64,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Well, {\i1}excuse{\i0} me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:40.78,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,And I was only up against a dummy Magitech\Nbuilt by the Engineering Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:42.08,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I'd be able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:42.89,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, {\i1}excuse{\i0} us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:51.40,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,After all, I'm here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:54.76,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Cut them apart! Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:58.32,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.50,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Himekawa's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.13,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:15.47,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The destructive powers of Neros and Kuros\Nare on a whole other level, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:20.47,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We need to develop weapons \Nthat are as good as Amaterasu's!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:22.97,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:57.53,Episode,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Episode Three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:57.53,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Gentle Days - Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:57.90,HybridTop,R,0000,0000,0000,,So that data was accurate after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:03.91,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,After Aine, Yurishia has succeeded\Nin her Heart Hybrid, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.91,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Now we can proceed as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:09.37,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:14.86,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The genius scientist,\NDr. Nayuta Hida, developed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:18.32,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,our strongest weapons and the only ones\Nthat can take on Magitechs:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.72,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,the Heart Hybrid Gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:20.80,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:26.06,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Great power always comes\Nat an even greater price, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:32.33,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what expression she's \Ngot on her face now, that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.76,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yurishia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:46.53,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,So, what did you think of my exploits\Nduring the training exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:50.20,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You fell in love a little, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.30,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:55.82,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No wonder you're the American ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.09,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I was impressed. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:01.09,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:03.99,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Then give me a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:11.02,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:15.74,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you want to go to the \NKyoto float for your reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:19.40,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Because I've always wanted to \Nhave a chance to go sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.36,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.99,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,is this temple the real deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:23.69,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's a replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:29.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,There wasn't enough time to get all our\Ncultural assets aboard the megafloats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.69,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:33.18,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see the real one someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:35.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.88,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Once we all go back to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:40.38,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That's why we're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.00,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.05,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go to the next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:48.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:59.31,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect to spend the day\Ntouring the megafloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:01.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that big,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:03.65,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,but it feels like we've \Ntraveled all over Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:06.61,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for dragging you along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.63,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,But it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:12.61,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're really proactive, Yurishia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:16.17,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Not many people would act on a crazy idea\Nlike this, even if they did think of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:18.48,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.92,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I think I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:22.42,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:26.66,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,When we were attacked by that\NMagitech weapon on that uninhabited island,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:30.43,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I might die,\N for the first time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:35.31,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,But when you saved me, this is what I felt:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:38.31,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to live my life more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:39.82,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.64,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I want to live my life more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:43.32,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I want to have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:46.86,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I want to do more things,\Nlike fall in love with a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:50.32,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:53.99,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,It's thanks to you that I can feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.51,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.34,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind her saying thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.80,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,but I don't know about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.74,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, is that you, Himekawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.10,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Hida-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:17.60,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Do you always stay at school this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:20.30,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The disciplinary committee sure has it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:23.03,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,There's no end of students causing problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:27.00,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Especially lewd boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:34.92,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,But I like this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:39.82,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I want to make the lives of my\Nfellow students as fun as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:43.23,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,That is my desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:44.63,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,as well as my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:54.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're really dedicated, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:57.08,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:58.44,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,L-Like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.40,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:01.44,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's indecent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:17.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Himekawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:20.16,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hida-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:35.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,A Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:36.82,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,In an instant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:38.46,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:43.70,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,How could I be so perverted?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.95,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Aine-san's always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.36,0:08:01.61,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,She always trains by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:05.26,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to spar with her, \Nso I went up to talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.60,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,but she ignored me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:09.71,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,At this point, everyone keeps\N their distance from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:13.05,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,She has a strange obsession with fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:18.72,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia-san and I don't know\N what she's thinking, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.78,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we're all part of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:27.52,HybridFlashback,Y,0000,0000,0000,,After all, I'm here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:39.05,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,So he managed to Hybrid Heart\N with Himekawa, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:44.39,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I can't run away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.04,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:51.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,She only came here in high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:53.17,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,so I don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:56.08,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.84,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.42,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:04.39,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Can I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:06.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.69,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What's this about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.70,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:18.88,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,This is my chance to learn \Nabout Chidorigafuchi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:21.70,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,but what do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:24.71,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:27.77,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you eaten yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:29.97,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:30.71,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:34.78,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:37.09,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:42.56,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.52,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are these handmade?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.35,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:48.22,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I bought them at a convenience store,\Ncut them in half,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.93,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,and put them in a lunchbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:52.36,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that qualifies as handmade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:53.62,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.91,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Then what is the definition of handmade?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:58.33,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:02.88,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,How strict is the definition?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:05.12,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,If I can't use something\N that's already made,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:08.87,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'd have to grow the wheat \Nfor the bread myself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:12.63,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'd have to go catch the tuna, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:16.11,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back. Can you wait here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.46,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:20.31,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I appreciate it very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.39,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:28.47,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,What am I doing here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:34.46,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:35.42,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:39.24,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,There's one other thing I want you to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.00,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Dessert or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.91,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, you can't mean—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.67,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?\NWe're in broad daylight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:56.81,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I read in one of those books that \Nif you do it in a place like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:59.43,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,the immorality of it\N turns the guy on more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of book did you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:02.70,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:07.64,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Come, Hybrid Heart with me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:13.26,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:18.57,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you talking about,\Nyou inferior life form?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:22.51,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think that I, of all people, \Nwould be scared of something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But you're shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:27.08,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm about to get my Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.83,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy, I'm shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:30.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Immoral Weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:32.33,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What's that... Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.40,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Is this still not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:45.42,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I getting excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:48.77,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I bet she's wearing a pilot suit\N underneath like before—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:50.60,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:54.94,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead. You can touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.48,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:58.22,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.32,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:06.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,They're so soft...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:10.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You can't force it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:15.48,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,And you have to think about \Nhow the other person feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.30,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.26,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:25.64,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let Yurishia and Hayuru\Nbeat me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:27.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:29.36,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:30.64,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.74,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care what happens to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:40.78,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:06.18,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:10.85,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,we're doing a Heart Hybrid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:27.61,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:30.65,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Not when you've got that look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:34.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know anything about me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:37.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't know anything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.07,0:13:41.45,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,So we need to take more time \Nto learn about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.18,0:13:43.78,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:46.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:48.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:52.22,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.89,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.89,0:13:56.63,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, it's Reiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.28,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.85,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Can we meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:02.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.34,0:14:07.26,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:13.67,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember this room, Kizuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:14.33,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:16.33,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I could never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:19.33,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:22.34,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...where it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:31.44,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I underwent the Core Install surgery\Nfor the Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:32.35,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:35.65,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:39.35,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But I did it for Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:42.36,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted Mom's approval,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:44.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,so I helped with the Gear experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.52,0:14:46.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.60,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:57.79,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:15:01.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That aside, there was something\NI wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.13,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:05.83,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to tell me what\Nyou know about Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.83,0:15:07.09,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:07.88,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:09.43,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:13.64,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Because I have to know about her, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.13,0:15:16.70,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What she's like, where she came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.70,0:15:18.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,why she's here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:25.15,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,There are no records of her earlier life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:29.15,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Seven years ago, in Chidorigafuchi, Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:32.73,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,a girl with no known identity was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.16,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,She had no memories
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:37.21,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,and didn't remember her name or identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Was that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:41.41,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that was Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:46.24,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,During the physical exam she took\Nas part of the efforts to identify her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:49.72,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,it was found that she had very \Nhigh compatibility with the Gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:52.43,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,So the lab took her in,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:55.43,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,as an experimental subject for that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:58.74,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Aine Chidorigafuchi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:00.86,HybridFlashback,A,0000,0000,0000,,Aine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:08.23,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Aine Chidorigafuchi is the name\Nthat woman gave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:11.79,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,After she took her in,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.69,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,her life at the lab began.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.79,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,All she ever did was\N take part in experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:20.15,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,But they suddenly came to an end
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.84,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,when Nayuta Hida disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:26.83,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,That woman disappeared one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:29.46,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,and we still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:32.42,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Or, of course, where she went.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.97,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:37.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:39.47,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:43.69,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been alone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:48.98,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It might take time, but I'm sure \Nwe can understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:52.54,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but our time is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.52,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:17:00.95,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The archive you're about to see \Nwas only recently discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:03.75,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No one but Reiri and I know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:05.39,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:06.81,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,It will link with your vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:08.83,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Linkage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:38.84,HybridFlashbackItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:40.44,HybridFlashbackItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't take any more....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.04,HybridFlashback,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Continue, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.82,HybridFlashbackItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But my Hybrid Count...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:48.04,HybridFlashback,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:53.10,HybridFlashback,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll take control of \Nthe Gear from here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.61,HybridFlashback,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Dr. N-Nayuta.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:17:59.84,HybridFlashback,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No... Doctor... stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:01.31,HybridFlashback,Foreground,0000,0000,0000,,Output increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:02.65,HybridFlashbackItalics,Background,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Someone, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.40,HybridFlashback,Foreground,0000,0000,0000,,Count has entered the danger zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:07.20,HybridFlashbackItalics,Background,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Stop it! No! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:05.77,HybridFlashback,Foreground,0000,0000,0000,,Subject's vitals are yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:11.56,HybridFlashback,,0000,0000,0000,,Count remaining: 7, 6, 5, 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.93,HybridFlashbackItalics,Background,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:12.87,HybridFlashbackItalics,Background,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:14.07,HybridFlashback,Count remaining,0000,0000,0000,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.55,HybridFlashback,Count remaining,0000,0000,0000,,Count zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.12,HybridFlashback,Count remaining,0000,0000,0000,,Vitals lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:20.07,HybridFlashback,Count remaining,0000,0000,0000,,Increasing maximum output value by 5.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.45,0:18:21.57,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.91,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,This was good data.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.68,0:18:32.84,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:34.52,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,As you just saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:38.89,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,the Hybrid Count is the energy \Nsource of the Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:41.62,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,At the same time, it is the \Nlife energy of the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:45.36,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,With the Eros, Zeros, Neros, and Kuros,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:47.85,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,all entries in the Ros series,\Nif their count drops to zero...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:49.77,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,The pilot dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:53.39,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,No one knows this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.39,0:18:55.23,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Not even the members of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:57.10,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,But, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:19:00.44,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,as the unit commander, \NI wanted you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:02.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:04.74,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Then everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,had those cores installed\Nwithout knowing anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:11.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,and they're risking their \Nlives each time they fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:15.55,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You knew that, and you \Nmade them fight anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:22.90,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This fact only came to light very recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:27.98,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,And do you think Reiri didn't suffer\Nwhen she found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:31.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Then that's just another reason\Nto find another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.81,0:19:33.02,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,We don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:36.22,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:40.07,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,This is all we have to fight the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:41.64,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,So what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:44.87,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,I have to order them to fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:46.53,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:49.58,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,That is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:53.08,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to hell for this, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:56.06,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:06.05,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,You're our one hope, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.41,0:20:08.64,HybridFlashback,K,0000,0000,0000,,The Heart Hybrid...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:12.15,HybridFlashbackItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only one who can save their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:17.52,HybridFlashbackItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That is the special feature of Eros,\Nthe Gear that was installed in you, a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:22.12,HybridFlashback,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the only one who can save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.58,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:31.77,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:34.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:35.92,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:39.38,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's my job to take care of you, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:41.52,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:42.59,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:46.97,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:50.04,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:53.14,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:54.98,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.15,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,If you need anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:21:00.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:05.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.92,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Captain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:24.96,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,An enemy fleet has appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:39.98,Illustration,,0000,0000,0000,,Illustration: Keita Hagio
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:28.59,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,I want my Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:31.92,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,Because fighting is the only reason\NI'm allowed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:33.34,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:36.09,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me who you really are, Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:39.98,Next Episode Title,,0001,0001,0160,,{\fad(900,1)}Next time: Climax Hybrid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.09,0:23:38.38,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't call me by my first name...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.38,0:23:39.21,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,Dummy.
